          "id": "india-asean-summit-manila-2026-11-17",
          "headline": "Modi at ASEAN-India summit: India and ASEAN should choose cooperation over rivalry",
          "summary": "Update: at the 23rd ASEAN-India Summit in Manila today, Prime Minister Modi said India's growth and ASEAN's prosperity are closely linked and the world needs peace, stability and predictability. He said ties are widening into digital technology, defence and space, and tied ASEAN's Vision 2045 to India's Viksit Bharat 2047 goal. He also attended the East Asia Summit.",
          "why_it_matters": "It sets India's tone with Southeast Asia, a key trade and supply-chain partner, amid US-China tension.",
