          "id": "india-bay-of-bengal-cyclone-2026-11-14",
          "headline": "Cyclone Akvan set to become very severe storm; Odisha starts evacuations",
          "summary": "The IMD expects Cyclone Akvan to strengthen into a very severe cyclonic storm and cross the Andhra Pradesh coast around noon on November 20, with winds up to about 145 km/h, Business Standard reported. New since earlier editions: Odisha has deployed 74 rescue teams and begun moving vulnerable people in its southern districts. Heavy rain alerts are out for coastal Andhra, Rayalaseema and Odisha.",
          "why_it_matters": "A strong landfall could disrupt ports, crops and power in Andhra Pradesh and Odisha.",
          "importance": 3,
          "lead": false,
