          "id": "world-hormuz-tankers-ukmto-2026-11-17",
          "headline": "UKMTO reports two tankers hit near Hormuz; Iran says ships struck its mines",
          "summary": "The UK's maritime monitor UKMTO reported two attacks on tankers near the Strait of Hormuz on Monday, one 7 nautical miles north of Khasab, Oman, each causing an engine-room fire with no casualties. Iran's IRGC and navy say three tankers hit mines; that claim is not independently confirmed and it is unclear if the incidents are the same. A drone also set off alarms over Iraq's Khor Mor gas field.",
          "why_it_matters": "More hits on shipping keep a risk premium in oil even as prices fall on a supply glut.",
