          "summary": "The Sensex was up about 0.5% at 82,500 and the Nifty at 25,415 around 1:40 pm, off the day's highs as IT and FMCG shares fell. Bank Nifty hit a record above 62,400, led by state-run lenders such as SBI. Tata Chemicals jumped about 9% and Tata Investment also rose after an RBI letter dated November 16 told Tata Sons to meet listing rules for large NBFCs.",
